    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/the-dawin-bangkok-hotel/hotel/bangkok-th.html",
    "name": "The Dawin Hotel",
    "detail": "Dawin Bangkok hotel is really a very nice almost brand new hotel. I have stayed in a Deluxe room, Superior Room and Standard Room. All rooms are fresh, very clean and beautifully furnished. Deluxe room is the biggest one. It has quite a big bathroom (no bathtub) however the room itself is not that big. It is the hall which is spacious. Superior room is slightly bigger then than the standard room, it has a bathtub. I did not really notice a difference comparing with the standard room. Staff very friendly. It is located on Soi 4, Sukhumvit, however it has been built at the very end of the lane in a quiet area. The swimming pool on 6 floor is also nice.I highly recommend this hotel, even if they increase the price. ",
